-- Regression for #1789 (paramUsedInArith/paramUseTy traversal gap): a
-- type-var Float param used arithmetically only inside a match arm (a
-- CDecision, what `match` lowers to), not directly in the enclosing
-- function body. Sibling shape to numpoly_traversal_lambda_arg.mdk (CLam)
-- -- this is the issue's own original repro, minimized to the `match` shape.
double x = match True
  True => x + x
  False => x

main = println (double 2.5)
